292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"桂隐纪咏四十八首 其二十六 依绿亭","author":"张镃","text":"月出烟暝时，水调谁家唱。\n短棹欲相寻，先经此亭上。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57353,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"桂隐纪咏四十八首 其二十三 拥山亭","author":"张镃","text":"掩抱复回环，亭居紫翠间。\n思量天下物，谁更好如山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57354,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"桂隐纪咏四十八首 其十六 易容轩","author":"张镃","text":"世界无非我，心怀即是天。\n玉堂并草舍，何地不安然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57355,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"桂隐纪咏四十八首 其三十五 松桥","author":"张镃","text":"欲向松间去，梅西竹坞穿。\n莫言吟兴在，风雪灞桥边。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57356,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"桂隐纪咏四十八首 其十八 玩芝轩","author":"张镃","text":"阴洞亲寻遍，灯惊蝙蝠飞。\n坚明敲紫玉，一似采时肥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57357,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"桂隐纪咏四十八首 其三十七 柳桥","author":"张镃","text":"初因桥种柳，却用柳名桥。\n桂隐从兹入，春风莫浪招。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57358,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"桂隐纪咏四十八首 其二十 俯巢轩","author":"